<title>USA: CCC buys 1,400 tonnes U.S. vegoil for Tajikistan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 1,400 tonnes U.S. vegoil for Tajikistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought a total of 1,400 tonnes U.S. vegetable oil for donation to Tajikistan.</p>
<p>The vegoil, was purchased in the range of $839.55 to $843.55 a tonne, free alongside ship, from Cal Western Packaging Corp, it said.</p>
<p>The CCC, a part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said shipment was for August 19-September 3.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
